# To [[apply]] or [[make use]] of (someone or something); to [[employ#Verb|employ]], to [[use#Verb|use]].
#* {{RQ:More Robinson Utopia|subchapter=Of Scyences Craftes and Occupatyons|sig=&#91;H.vij.&#93;|page=140|passage=All the voide time, that is betwene the huores of woorke ſlepe and meat, that they be ſuffered to '''beſtowe''', euerye man as he lyketh beſte hym ſelfe.}}
#* {{RQ:John Ford Loues Sacrifice|page=11|passage=[S]ince the voyce / Of moſt ſupreme Authority commands / My abſence: I determine to '''beſtovv''' / Some time in learning Languages abroad; {{...}}}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|title=From Richmond Park. A Poem.|editor=Sylvanus Urban [pseudonym; {{w|Edward Cave}}]|magazine=[[w:The Gentleman's Magazine|The Gentleman’s Magazine: Or, Monthly Intelligencer]]|location=London|publisher={{...|Printed, and sold at St. John’s Gate: By}} F. Jefferies,{{nb...|in Ludgate-street, all other booksellers; and by the persons who seve gentlemen with the newspapers.}}|month=September|year=1734|page=505|pageurl=https://books.google.com/books?id=I1c3AAAAYAAJ&pg=PA505|column=1|oclc=677163097|passage=''Richmond'', thy purling ſtreams and pleaſing ſhades, / Might claim the chorus of ''Aonian'' maids; / VVhere e’en ''Apollo'' might his hours '''beſtovv''', / By turns employ his lyre, by turns his bovv, / VVhere all the pleaſures dvvell, vvhich poets feign / On fair ''Arcadia''’s fields or ''Tempe''’s plain.}}
## {{lb|en|specifically|obsolete}} To apply ([[money#Noun|money]]) for some [[purpose#Noun|purpose]]; to [[expend]], to [[spend#Verb|spend]].
