##* {{RQ:Holinshed Chronicles|volume=II|chapter=King [[w:Henry VIII|Henry the Eyghte]]|page=1472|column=2|passage=The ſixteene daye of May they were al '''beſtovved''' abourd in Spaniſh ſhippes furniſhed with victual, & other neceſſaries for that iourney.}}
