##* {{RQ:Jonson Bartholomew Fair|scene=i|page=51|passage=VVell my Maſters, I'le leaue him with you; novv I ſee him '''beſtovv'd''', I'le goe looke for my goods, and ''Numps''.}}
##* {{RQ:Byron Sardanapalus|act=III|scene=i|page=87|passage=See that the women are '''bestow'd''' in safety / In the remote apartments: let a guard / Be set before them, with strict charge to quit / The post but with their lives— {{...}}}}
